Package: toukeiatlas
Title: Japan Statistical Atlas (toukei-atlas)
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Static thematic-map atlas of Japanese official statistics,
    rendered with sf + ggplot2 and published as a static site on Vercel.
    This DESCRIPTION pins the dependency list; the project is built with
    build/build_all.R, not R CMD build.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    sf,
    dplyr,
    readr,
    readxl,
    ggplot2,
    glue,
    jsonlite,
    rmapshaper,
    digest
Suggests:
    testthat,
    cartogram
